<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 74,600 MT were 47 percent below the previous week and two-fifths less than the 4-week average.  The major increases were for El Salvador (15,500 MT), Ecuador (10,000 MT), Jamaica (9,100 MT), and the Dominican Republic (8,300 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 105,500 MT were one-third above the previous week, but 15 percent less than the 4-week average.  The Philippines (20,000 MT), Australia (17,000 MT), Algeria (15,800 MT), and Turkey (10,800 MT) were the major recipients.</p>
</text>
